lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn the office, Wang Qiang is the project team leader, and Zhang Wei is Wang Qiang's old deputy. The project team recently brings in a new member Li Li, Wang Qiang and Zhang Wei do not know much about her technical background. Today, Wang Qiang and Zhang Wei arrange for Li Li to complete a task independently, and this task is usually Zhang Wei's responsibility. Li Li works hard in front of the computer, Zhang Wei stands behind her for a while, then walks towards Wang Qiang, the two exchange a complex look. Wang Qiang nods slightly, Zhang Wei returns to his seat, they do not have further conversation. Li Li notices all of this, but continues to focus on her screen.\n\n[Question]\nAfter watching Li Li work for a while, how does Zhang Wei possibly feel?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Wei is curious about whether Li Li is competent.\nB. Zhang Wei feels disappointed, thinking that Li Li's ability is not enough.\nC. Zhang Wei feels relaxed because someone can share his work.\nD. Zhang Wei possibly feels marginalized.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021826482618728044,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58f1e9aa9dc5a833d6427","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477854975,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:04:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"999f214d92d54709a2745070f5abd43f"}